cienne école. On y retrouve l’ambiance d’une école primaire de la fin du XIXe  et début XXe siècle.","photo":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/20/Museum_of_the_History_of_Polish_Jews_in_Warsaw_Main_exhibition_Gwo%C5%BAdziec_synagogue.jpg/960px-Museum_of_the_History_of_Polish_Jews_in_Warsaw_Main_exhibition_Gwo%C5%BAdziec_synagogue.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","photoCredit":"Illustration · Magdalena Starowieyska, Dariusz Golik, CC BY-SA 3.0 pl","photoGeneric":true},{"id":"dt-place-ebd12a85-1dc2-3dc7-bdad-58d12cd7c5cc","isPlace":true,"scene":"village","city":"laval","category":"À voir","title":"Basilique Notre-Dame d'Avesnières","date":null,"time":"","place":"Place d'Avesnières, Laval","lat":48.0597592,"lng":-0.7632123,"price":"Voir sur place","thumb":"","source":"datatourisme","createdAt":1791427535099,"description":"Le chevet étagé de style roman, élevé au cours du XIIè siècle, est la partie la plus remarquable de l'édifice. Le choeur est ceint d'un déambulatoire s'ouvrant sur 5 chapelles rayonnantes. Les fondations datent de la première moitié du XIIè siècle.","photo":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e2/Basilique_Notre-Dame_d%27Avesni%C3%A8res_17.JPG/960px-Basilique_Notre-Dame_d%27Avesni%C3%A8res_17.JPG?utm_source=fr.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","photoCredit":"Wikimedia Commons"},{"id":"dt-place-bbc32153-9711-3306-869b-2d2223f718ca","isPlace":true,"scene":"village","city":"laval","category":"À voir","title":"Théâtre les 3 Chênes","date":null,"time":"","place":"3 rue du Pays de Loiron, Loiron-Ruillé","lat":48.069749,"lng":-0.93363,"price":"Voir sur place","thumb":"","source":"datatourisme","createdAt":1791427535099,"description":"Les 3 Chênes : un lieu dédié à la diffusion, à la création et aux pratiques artistiques et culturelles","photo":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/78/Palais_Garnier%27s_grand_salon%2C_12_February_2008.